@startuml
title Book and pay for a class | FR-007/009 | BR-021–026/033–038/068
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam activityBorderColor #475569
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #475569
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam stateBorderColor #475569
actor Learner as L
participant "Class booking" as C
participant "Background payment processing" as P
participant Wallet as W
L -> C: Ask to book a class
C -> C: Check class timing, duration, seats,\nno self-booking and no existing active booking
alt Repeat of the same request
 C --> L: Return the existing booking
else Booking is not allowed
 C --> L: Explain why, no payment taken
else Booking is allowed
 C -> C: Hold a seat for 15 minutes and keep the agreed price
 C --> L: Awaiting confirmation
end
L -> C: Confirm an awaiting booking
C -> C: Save confirmation and arrange payment processing
C --> L: Booking confirmed, payment has not finished yet
C -> P: Request wallet payment in the background
P -> W: Deduct full class price and allocate income and fee together
alt Payment succeeds
 W -> W: Keep Teacher income on hold and record platform fee
 W --> P: Payment recorded, repeated processing cannot charge again
else Payment fails, including insufficient balance
 W --> P: Payment could not be recorded
 P -> P: Retry, retain unresolved failures for investigation
 note over C,W
 Current gap against BR-022/026:
 confirmation remains saved when payment fails.
 Automatic cancellation of that confirmation is not implemented.
 end note
end
note over L,C: This describes current backend behavior.\nWeb and mobile booking screens call the same endpoints.
@enduml
